# Files outside the CLI smoke runner: a glob, then the reason.
**/*.py       Host library sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.ts       Host library sample; check against the TypeScript package.
**/*.rb       Host library sample; check against the Ruby package.
**/*.R        Host library sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.rs       Host library sample; check against the Rust crate.
**/*.c        Native sample; compile against the current C header.
**/*.cpp      Native sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.m        Native sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.cob      Native sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.adb      Native sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.java     Host library sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.kt       Host library sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.scala    Host library sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.cs       Host library sample; smoke-bindings.mjs replays the ones REPLAY lists.
**/*.csproj   The project file a C# sample builds with.
**/*.sql      SQL sample; check against the matching installed extension.
**/*.sql.out  Saved output from a checked database sample.
REPLAY        The samples smoke-bindings.mjs replays.
bindings-proof.json  What smoke-bindings.mjs proved; check-binding-proofs.mjs reads it.
